A-Share Multi-Agent Research

This repository is a derivative work based on TradingAgents by Tauric Research:
https://github.com/TauricResearch/TradingAgents

Original project: TradingAgents: Multi-Agents LLM Financial Trading Framework
Original authors: Yijia Xiao, Edward Sun, Di Luo, Wei Wang
Original license: Apache License 2.0

This derivative adds/refactors A-share data adaptation, deterministic candidate discovery,
LangGraph workflow pruning and parallelization, an independent decision auditor,
MCP-based tool exposure, PIT-aware hybrid RAG, multi-turn conversation state,
FastAPI service endpoints, Docker Compose orchestration, and regression tests.

No API keys, refresh tokens, or local .env files are intentionally included.
